[E-PROP-ELIM] Error: can't match on a proof of `Loop` to produce data
    ╭─[ soundness/self-referential-prop-elim.sw:15:3 ]
    │
 15 │ ╭─▶   match l with
 16 │ ├─▶     | MkLoop n => Succ (steps n)
    │ │                                      
    │ ╰────────────────────────────────────── the result type `Nat` isn't a proposition
    │     
    │     Note: `Loop` is a proposition, so its proofs are erased at runtime. Its field `next` holds a proof of `Loop` itself, and matching on such a proof can only produce another proof: otherwise checking whether two of its uses are equal could go on forever.
